Your Brand in Glass.</h2>
            <p class="of-ftype__desc">Decorative and branded window film transforms ordinary glass into a design asset. From subtle frosted gradients to full company logo cut-outs, 3M FASARA's 100+ patterns and custom graphics options give Philadelphia offices a polished, branded look at a fraction of custom etched glass cost. Ideal for lobbies, reception desks, and conference room partitions.</p>
            <div class="of-ftype__faq">
              <div class="of-ftype__faq-item">
                <button class="of-ftype__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can we print our company logo on the film?<span class="of-ftype__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
                <div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>Yes. Custom-cut logos, wordmarks, and graphic shapes are a popular option for Philadelphia law firms, financial offices, and tech companies. We work with your design files and can produce custom-cut or digitally printed film in most shapes and sizes for interior or exterior glass applications.</div>
