                <div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>3M FASARA interior decorative films carry an expected performance life of 5–20 years depending on the specific pattern and application. Interior glass (not directly weathered) typically achieves longer service life. We include the manufacturer's documentation with every installation.</div>
