                <button class="of-ftype__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can it be removed later if we rebrand?<span class="of-ftype__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
                <div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>Yes — professionally installed decorative film is removable without damaging the glass. This makes it ideal for leased spaces where permanent modifications aren't permitted. When you rebrand or move, we can remove the existing film and install updated branding on your new space.</div>
